    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>2024的第一场旅行，去西安感受一次人间烟火的味道</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>节目时长<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a>开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a>再次冲动旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a>23.12.28下班后直奔机场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a>29参观了陕西历史博物馆秦汉馆，很幸运成为了第一批观众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a>博物馆里的文物真的好多！这里真的随意就能挖到宝贝！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a>逛完秦汉馆之后前往西安城墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a>西安人的城墙下是西安人的火车，是人间烟火的味道~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">04:36</a>独自去了酒吧小酌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a>30号上午参观了陕西历史博物馆老馆，里面有好多文物表情包，超可爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a>到钟楼看了夜景，请路人拍了与钟楼的合影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a>又跑到了大唐不夜城散步，没想到遇到了小偷!!!!!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a>在陕拾叁里猎奇到了油泼辣子味和中华豆腐味的冰淇淋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">10:58</a>最后一天来到了秦始皇兵马俑博物馆，讲解员告诉我们活人不要与泥人合照，也不要购买兵马俑的小雕塑，因为有忌讳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a>晚上到永兴坊逛吃结束后，又散步去了钟楼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a>大家都在钟楼等着跨年，连地铁站里都是摩肩接踵!!!!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a>24.1.1上午坐飞机回上海~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a>如果因为担心时间与行程，每次想出去旅游时总是拖拖拖，不能成功旅游的话，不妨试试冲动式旅游</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>毛不易 - 胡同</span></p><span></span><p><span>程渤智 - 西安人的歌</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>西安</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpjY7jTgYucTfVKT2Y4re1jbkIX5.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvGGUbtvfiBK-qVNt9HVrJy_Wc0k.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnCa_Z93CbaWUjncGHPFbgBgKc81.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXH-QkFOsVTDcMaytiM6SF7vN8h.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhZizYQ4ftiNEClmUENApvGSOj9.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
