    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL 3. 2023的旅行，发现不同的自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658401953d5d24e9cb7134b3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658401953d5d24e9cb7134b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Dec 2023 09:12:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2023年快要结束了，今年的你去了多少不同的地方，看了多少不同的景，遇见了多少不同的人？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>旅行者不是旅游者，不是游山玩水的旁观者。旅行者是人类的观察者，走过阴晴风雨，遍阅人间悲欣，既在其中，又在其外。从不纠结于现世得失，将生命当作一次山重水复的旅程，将隐藏在视觉深处的万千气象告诉四面八方。——梁永安</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>节目时长<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a>花絮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a>开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a>人为什么要旅行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a>小时候不喜欢旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a>长大后的旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">04:34</a>在旅行中发现不同的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a>一时冲动定下了去西北的机票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">08:21</a>在西北感受世界感受自然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">09:34</a>开启社牛模式，和沙葱牛肉饼摊位的老板和老板娘唠嗑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a>藏民热情地在我们离店时对我们说“扎西德勒”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a>找到适合自己旅行的方式，使灵魂和肉体都在路上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>期待元旦自己一个人的西安旅行~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>钰见·梵星 - 一笺清浅入夏来</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>沙葱牛肉饼</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlC-0Ai6U4Y_c8NHrUhIzVhZVklt.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2eTw3wihDDdWZNgPBQXSpp9mXJ.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lohq_WuWiisJMZXYEr1YR_ME6Sjz.m4a" length="15146142" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh4At15dRTY5BX7SI301kqVDrm8h.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
